Weekly "Hotteste globalt" manifests land here, one per ISO week
(<YYYY-Www>.md), proposed by .github/workflows/scan-hot-skills.yml and
published by .github/workflows/resolve-hot-ranking.yml when the PR is merged.

Merged manifests are the curation ledger, the same role submission-review.yml
gives merged submission manifests: PRODUCT.md bets the positioning on
"curated, never scraped", and a git history of every accepted ranking with a
reviewer and a timestamp is that claim made auditable. Do not delete them.
